    "body": "I don't think so because \"allow declarative shadow roots\" is only false for inert documents created for the purpose of fragment-parsing, and those are never cloned AFAICT.\r\n\r\nIn blink \"allow declarative shadow roots\" is a fragment parser config rather than something that stays on the document.",
